    "AirStore can only install marketplace apps that have been notarized by Apple.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs-review",
            "value": "侧店只能安装已由苹果验证的市场应用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirStore cannot manage the existing certificate without owning its private key. The apps signed with the existing certificate will expire soon unless they are resigned and renewed explicitly by AirStore.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs-review",
            "value": "AirStore 无法管理现有的证书，除非拥有其私钥。使用现有证书签名的应用将在不久的将来过期，除非它们被 AirStore 显式重新签署并更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirStore communicates with on-device services over a local loopback VPN. Enable LocalDevVPN before verifying.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs-review",
            "value": "AirStore 通过本地回环 VPN 与设备上的服务通信。在验证前，请先启用 LocalDevVPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirStore does not have detailed information for these entitlements.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs-review",
            "value": "AirStore 不提供这些权限的详细信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirStore requires an Apple ID to create development certificates and provisioning profiles for signing apps.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirStore 需要 Apple ID 来创建签名应用所需的开发证书和描述文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
